<title>USA: Applied Cellular acquires pump maker.</title>
<headline>Applied Cellular acquires pump maker.</headline>
<dateline>NIXA, Mo. 1997-01-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Applied Cellular Technology Inc said Thursday it agreed to acquire East Hanover, N.J.-based MVAK Technologies Inc, which remanufactures and services vacuum pumps used in semiconductor, medical and electronics manufacturing.</p>
<p>MVAK had fiscal 1996 year revenues of about $2.6 million. 1997 revenues are estimated at $3.5 million.</p>
<p>Terms of the transaction were not disclosed.</p>
<p>		((Chicago newsdesk 312 408 8787))</p>
